      "short_description": "Sverica Capital Management is a lower middle market private equity firm founded in 2001, focusing on growth-oriented investments in healthcare, technology/business services, and advanced industrial sectors. With $2 billion in committed capital across six funds, Sverica has completed 47 platform investments and operates offices in Austin, Boston, and San Francisco. The firm employs a \"business builder\" approach, actively supporting portfolio companies to enhance their growth strategies.\n\nSverica targets leading companies in the lower middle market, particularly those with recurring revenue or replicable unit economics. The firm primarily engages in control buyouts, investing in companies with enterprise values under $250 million. Its core sectors include technology, healthcare, and advanced industrial, with a focus on companies that demonstrate strong market fundamentals and high returns on invested capital. The team at Sverica is composed of professionals with diverse backgrounds, emphasizing a collaborative approach to foster growth and implement ESG policies across its operations.",
